  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3be3048eed6de9b48a1a9ab3da6b5b67, type: 3}
  m_Name: BeasthunterCavalry
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Beasthunter Cavalry
  role: 3
  description: Using techniques originally developed for hunting megafauna this anti-tank
    cavalry has the firepower to crack armor and the mobility to stay alive. Three
    Rask on motorcycles (a Rask Superior Rider and two Rask Riders), each with a
    wrist-mounted Mag-grenade Launcher (5 damage, penetration 5, 20 m), which does
    7 damage to an Armor 4 tank and 5 to the Stinger's Armor 5. They have the Rask
    Rifleman's 5 health, Armor Level 1 and 75% accuracy, but ride 40 m a turn; as
    Cavalry they can't sprint. A Specialist, so you can field more than one.
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 487383d655802a2499fd009fc1584725, type: 2}
